                </div>

            </div>

        </div>
        <div id="right">

            <div id="right-box">

                There is nothing in
                this world constant
                but inconstancy.

            </div>

        </div>




        <div id="footer">

            Designed by
            <a href="#">Ben Meadowcroft</a>

        </div>


    </div>

</body>
</html>